{"parse": {"title": "FT-22", "pageid": 55372, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FT-21\" title=\"FT-21\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FT-22</span><a href=\"/wiki/FT-23\" title=\"FT-23\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FT</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">22</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.97.A8.E5.89.8D.E8.B6.B3.E9.9F.B3\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"门前足音\">门前足音</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 门前足音</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Unanswered Door</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>咚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>咚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>咚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2010122</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_huatian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_huatian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>废墟之前，一个身影驻足已久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-300810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-300810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-300810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿若沉默的墓碑，他将所有一切拒之门外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>足音从背后响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>勿忘我先生，您果然在这……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>引导之人说过，她不希望您再回来这片……庄园。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>背影仍旧沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>圣洛夫基金会又清理掉了位于旧金山的一个“密勿之地”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您不想……亲自去一趟吗？让那些白袍子见见血。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处的背影，缓缓转了过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可他的眼中没有丝毫渴盼，只是空洞，一片空洞，犹如吞掉光的深井。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>你能看见吗？最早时，那是一片荒芜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-624901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-624901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-624901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>接着，不可计数的神秘学家，以数百代、数千代的子嗣的遗骨与鲜血，才筑造了通向它的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>他们狂喜，以头颅亲吻大地——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>最终却发现，在那尽头空无一物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这时，她才发现执于他手中的那本古旧泛黄的书籍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但书籍之名已无法辨认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"625501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"625501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/HeadIconSmall-625501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-625501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我……不明白您的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他恍然之间意识到了什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这时女孩颤颤巍巍的身影，才算映进了他的眼中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>罢了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>……我知道你想说什么，传道者下达了使命，需要我们尽快回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>她听到了新的神谕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处的女孩受宠若惊一般，连连颔首。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/15/HeadIconSmall-300801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">勿忘我：</div><div>该走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们离开这片寂静之地，直到将要迈出门扉——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他又停下来，回首望向这片废墟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是最后一次。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chenei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chenei\"><img alt=\"chenei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/600px-Cg-chenei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/900px-Cg-chenei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/Cg-chenei.png/1200px-Cg-chenei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">司机：</div><div>……动起来，动起来啊，宝贝儿！这鸟不拉屎的地方，拖车公司可会把我这条肥羔羊宰死！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">司机：</div><div>该死，为了几张破钞票，这下我跟我的宝贝儿都要折在这了……呜呜呜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轮胎塌陷在泥巴当中，寸步难行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人瘫坐在座位上，丝毫没有心情理会后座忧心忡忡的乘客。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唔……根据基金会给我的地图，这里离妈妈的安全屋还有好一段距离……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唉……最后还是必须得靠伟大的玛蒂尔达自己。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">司机：</div><div>嘿，等、等——小姐，你还没把钱付给我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他慌张得就要从车窗蹿出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304122.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304122.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>三张、五张、八张……二十张——喏，这是尊贵的玛蒂尔达小姐给你的小费，希望能弥补一些你的损失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>哼哼，你要知道，像我这样尊贵又慷慨的客人可不多见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>接下来我会自己徒步过去，不过你要守在这里，大方的玛蒂尔达回来后会再慷慨一次！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">司机：</div><div>好、好的，小姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他激动地舔着手指，数着钞票，顿时忘记了所有烦忧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达提着箱子，一摇一晃地离去了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>循着深入森林的小径，她的背影渐渐消失在了幽暗的枝丫之间……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>理所当然，司机始终没有察觉到她刻意施展在引擎上的术式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>圣洛夫基金会安全屋的选址向来属于保密信息，一切都是为了防患于未然……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304123.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-304123.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304123.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304123.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-304123.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304123.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c5/HeadIconSmall-304123.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304123.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>藏踪匿迹！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这下就能把足迹隐藏起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唉，这时候如果十四——如果有个得力助手在身边就好了……还能跟我一块去见妈妈，顺带帮我提提箱子，我的手都要累酸了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小小的身影嘀咕着，一步一个脚印。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我……一点儿也感知不到妈妈的术式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>不过，如果按照拉普拉斯科算中心的那群家伙信誓旦旦说的……就连鼻子最灵敏的格拉瓦库斯，也找不见哪怕一根她的发丝……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>希望妈妈一切平安……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她加紧了脚步，拨开丛密的叶子——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwumenwai_ye\"><img alt=\"muwumenwai_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/600px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/900px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/1200px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一间屋子携着希望之光，显现于眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>那是……！哼哼，我就知道！重塑之手那群笨家伙怎么可能抓得住妈妈，作为首屈一指的占卜导师兼举世闻名的水晶疗愈师，她早就做好了准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>山腰上的光带走了黑暗，也一齐带走了她的不安。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>哼哼，等她待会看见优秀的女儿久违拜访，肯定会大吃一惊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>第一防线学校的食堂对法国菜一窍不通，我都快怀念死了妈妈做的正宗普罗旺斯菜肴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>而且最要紧的是，得让妈妈重新给我挑选一个水晶球……唉，这道占卜时出现的裂痕，连最优秀的水晶修复师也说无能为力……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>远处，木屋的灯光摇摇晃晃，仿若悬在一片漆黑之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门虚掩着，似乎早已预知了将要到访的客人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304117.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-304117.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304117.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304117.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-304117.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304117.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-304117.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304117.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>哼哼……尊敬的布翁尼女士，快来看看是谁来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门扇被轻轻推开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>死寂笼罩着这个空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风肆无忌惮地穿梭，撕扯着窗帘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>数十颗、数百颗——水晶球滚落在地，犹如被扯断线的珍珠项链。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们堆满屋子，无一不布满了网状的裂痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304121.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304121.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-304121.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304121.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……妈妈？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FT-22"}}